ower so it was dark in there.<br/>•\tThe first bedroom has a very soft bed that is uncomfortable. Also there is clear tape around the air conditioner unit in that room that leaves a gap between the window and the unit. <br/>•\tThe back patio is run down and not a space I would want to hang out in. <br/>•\tThe location is right next to highways and under a bunch of crossing overpasses. Not very attractive but surprisingly did not hear highway noise. <br/>Was it terrible? No. But for the money and given the reviews, I was expecting to love the place. <br/>Earl, it would be great if you and your associates could spend a little money to freshen up the place and make it look nicer. Thanks!
